---
// Editorial "about" — big display type with inline media chips (Stodio language).
---

<section id="story" class="relative bg-cream px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 sm:py-32">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
		<p data-reveal="fade" class="eyebrow text-ink/60">Our Story</p>

		<h2 data-reveal class="display mt-8 max-w-5xl text-[clamp(1.9rem,5.2vw,4rem)] text-ink/85">
			We grow tea the
			<span class="mx-1.5 inline-grid h-[0.72em] w-[1.4em] -translate-y-[0.04em] place-items-center overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-brand align-middle">
				<span class="animate-spin-slow text-[0.42em] leading-none text-lime">✿</span>
			</span>
			slow way — beside the
			<span class="text-brand">small growers</span>
			who tend every leaf by hand.
		</h2>

		<div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] md:items-end">
			<div data-reveal="left" class="order-2 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:order-1">
				<div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-sand">
					<div class="animate-gradient h-full w-full" style="background-image:radial-gradient(70% 70% at 30% 20%, rgba(63,125,84,0.9), transparent), radial-gradient(60% 60% at 80% 90%, rgba(231,163,58,0.7), transparent); background-color:#123f24"></div>
				</div>
				<div class="mt-8 aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-sand">
					<div class="animate-gradient h-full w-full" style="background-image:radial-gradient(70% 70% at 70% 30%, rgba(183,226,58,0.8), transparent), radial-gradient(60% 60% at 20% 80%, rgba(31,107,59,0.9), transparent); background-color:#1f6b3b; animation-delay:-4s"></div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div data-reveal="right" class="order-1 md:order-2">
				<p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/75 text-pretty">
					Wayomile began with a simple belief — that the finest cup starts with fairness. We work
					directly with family-run gardens, roast and blend in small batches, and pack only when you
					order. No middlemen, no shortcuts, no compromise on taste.
				</p>
				<a
					href="#shop"
					class="group mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-ink px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-cream transition hover:bg-brand"
				>
					Meet the blends
					<span class="transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
